# New load_briefs() reads roster-local/brief/latest.json from follow-alongs and algebra2-live-worksheet (read-only, fail-soft).
# One line per section meeting today or later; flags a failed AP Stats pull and briefs older than 36 hours.
# Lines pass through ok_line(); no model call.  Apply: cd C:/Users/rober/daily-itinerary && git apply <this file>  (or patch -p1)
